<li><strong>Terra Nova</strong> (La Grande Conversation), <strong>Telos</strong>, <strong>Global Taiwan Institute</strong> (Washington D.C.), <strong>Taiwan Insight</strong> (université de Nottingham). <a href="/publications/">Voir les publications →</a></li>
